      "key": "sealiesoftware",
      "name": "Hamster Emporium (Greg Parker)",
      "lang": "en",
      "homepage": "http://sealiesoftware.com/blog/",
      "note": "ObjC runtime 一手源头（non-pointer isa、objc_msgSend、tagged pointer）。HTTPS 已彻底失效只能走 HTTP，消失风险全清单最高，优先级第一。",
